[General]
Video=Unreal Gold Video Configuration

[Descriptions]
D3DDrv.D3DRenderDevice=Direct3D hardware rendering.  3dfx card owners should select 3dfx Glide Support.  Compatible with newer video cards like the Matrox G400, NVIDIA GeForce, GeForce2, TNT, TNT2, ATI Radeon, Rage 128, and S3 Savage4 Savage2000.
OpenGLDrv.OpenGLRenderDevice=OpenGL hardware rendering. This is provided for testing and experimentation, but has known compatibility issues with some drivers.
GlideDrv.GlideRenderDevice=3dfx hardware rendering using Glide.  3dfx card required -- the optimal choice for 3dfx card owners (Voodoo, Voodoo2, Banshee, Voodoo3, Voodoo4, and Voodoo5).
MetalDrv.MetalRenderDevice=For users with S3 Savage4 video cards.
SoftDrv.SoftwareRenderDevice=Unreal Gold's built-in software renderer. Compatible with all video cards.

